From eb684508330388c2d54d5a65685ffe54b59a2d62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Geoff Miller <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:36:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/27] fix(store): share native payloads across newest test
 cases

Keep one SQLite read snapshot and preserve per-test newest selection,
legacy schema handling and per-call native freshness validation. Return
each selected run payload once and share its immutable string.

Verified: focused selection fixture; store and testevidence race suites.
The retained one-iteration allocation benchmark changed from 53,796,368
to 445,232 B/op. Full upstream gate and real cold qualification pending.
---
